10\t- Name-list fields: emit CD bytes as-is for hostile names (`../`, `/abs`, `\\`, dupes). Decoy names (`*-with-bom.txt`,\n   211\t  `.exe` that is text, `.bin` that is PDF): bytes win every time.\n   212\t- Timed windows are seconds; most of it is GM round-trips (D19 start 2.4-2.8 s + download 2.7-3.2 s + submit 1.9 s;\n   213\t  solve ~1 s). Parse in memory, never shell out/extract to disk in-window; decompress each member once, cache by\n   214\t  (set zip, member).\n   215\t- Normalizing a stored value (D13): don't strip braces/reshape a stored string because answer_format sounds generic.\n   216\t- Hex width (D10): `\"0x%x\"` drops leading zeros; print `0x%0{2*size}x`. `_rva` = raw field, never ImageBase + it.\n   217\t  Require `PE\\0\\0` at e_lfanew before any PE field; require `\\x7fELF` before any ELF field.\n   218\t- Tools installed: exiftool, poppler, qpdf, mutool, pdf-parser, pdfid, pngcheck, zsteg, steghide, binwalk, foremost,\n   219\t  mediainfo, sqlite3, ImageMagick, readelf/objdump, olevba/oleid, olefile, pefile, pyelftools, LnkParse3, dnfile,\n   220\t  mutagen (.venv); msitools under tools/msitools; ffmpeg 7.0.2 (no ffprobe) at\n   221\t  `tools/imageio_ffmpeg_pkg/imageio_ffmpeg/binaries/ffmpeg-linux-x86_64-v7.0.2` (not on PATH). NOT installed: ffprobe, sox.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QBz6oFwj8yLZdskiy1iudR","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
